1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,500
DejaView is not an ordinary retrieval-augmented chatbot.
It is a sovereign, local digital memory.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:14,500
Screens, text, timelines, vectors, and the user model stay on this Mac.
The Radeon server supplies stateless compute only.

3
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:22,500
ACT 1 — Five logical roles run on an AMD Radeon PRO W7900D:
brain, perceive, sentinel, fast, and embed, routed through LiteLLM.

4
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:31,000
rocm-smi identifies the gfx1100 GPU. Grafana shows utilization,
VRAM, per-role throughput, and the memory-event rate on one screen.

5
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:41,500
ACT 2 — Three safe synthetic windows enter the real pipeline.
The Sentinel decides first; PP-OCRv6 extracts verbatim text and boxes.

6
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:52,000
Perceive creates specific semantics; embed stores 1,024-D vectors.
The timeline grows from one seed to four events, all on this Mac.

7
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:00,000
ACT 3 — A bank-login screen is blocked at the first privacy gate.
The result is BLOCKED, with an audit reference.

8
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Zero screenshot files and zero timeline rows are created.
Rejected pixels never enter searchable memory.

9
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:16,500
ACT 4 — The user asks which ROCm pull request was viewed
last Wednesday afternoon. DejaView answers: PR #1842.

10
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:25,000
The answer includes event ID, time, application, source screenshot,
and text bounding boxes: verifiable memory, not a model guess.

11
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:33,500
ACT 5 — Honcho answers a different question:
not “What did I see?”, but “Which approach is more like me?”

12
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:42,000
Nine isolated synthetic conclusions favor local, inspectable,
configuration-driven workflows. No real user data is used.

13
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:52,000
ACT 6 — Planner, Retriever, Writer, and Reviewer generate today's report.
Retriever is limited to today's three events.

14
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:02,000
The brain model writes on Radeon ROCm; Reviewer validates every citation.
The first evidence-backed report completes successfully.

15
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:09,500
Now the exact attested Radeon SSH compute link is disconnected visibly.
Wi-Fi stays connected; no physical cable pull is simulated.

16
00:02:09,500 --> 00:02:17,000
The product reports LINK DOWN and LOCAL READY.
The remote brain route is no longer available.

17
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:27,500
The same report runs again on independently verified Local Metal fallback.
Planner, Retriever, Writer, and Reviewer all complete.

18
00:02:27,500 --> 00:02:37,200
All three citations pass again. Remote compute can disappear;
local memory, agent workflow, and data sovereignty survive.
